//================================================================
// module Top
// Author: Neha Karanjkar
//
// The top-level module Sitar requires for `sitar compile`. It looks for
// a module literally named Top. Just instantiates Core. Kept as its own
// file rather than folded into Core.sitar so that Core stays a reusable
// submodule.
//================================================================

module Top
	submodule core : Core
end module
